\pard\b\fs20 Battle for Wedok\b0\par
\fs16\par
The sanctuary in the magic forest of Wedok had long been an important strategic point. For a long time it was ruled by the wise King Matthes. But when he set out some time ago on a journey to the other end of the world and was never seen again, a dispute broke out over this sanctuary. Merten, a brave warrior and the leader of a group of paladins of the Blood Church, claimed the valley for himself. David, who commanded a group of paladins of the Church of Light, was convinced otherwise. So they decided that the leader who could hold the sanctuary for 5 minutes in a row should rule over Wedok. Only until the king returned, of course...\par
